service#player
    | Abstract service that centralizes the music player
    state
        status.enum(default="stopped")
            | playing | paused | stopped
        source.url
            | Source that is being played, normally /audio/{id}.opus or /preview?url=...
        current-time.time
            | Current time that the player is playing
        duration.time
            | Total duration of the current track
        iteration_mode.enum(default="cycle-playlist")
            | cycle-playlist | cycle-song | no-cycle
    
    action#play(audio)
        | Plays the provided audio, if an audio is currently running, switch the audio to that
    
    action#pause()
        | Pauses the playing audio

    action#resume()
        | Resumes the paused audio

    event#on_end()
        | Triggers when a song finishes playing
        if iteration_mode == "cycle-playlist"
            | Go to next song, if this is the last song go to the first one
        else if iteration_mode == "cycle-song"
            | Repeat the same song
        else if iteration_mode == "no-cycle"
            | Stop playing, set status to "paused"

    